WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.820
SPEAKER: Today, we're talking
about Apigee X, baseball

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:09.910
and BigQuery, AI workshops for
free, and ML inspired candy.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:12.310
Welcome to "This Week in
Cloud," where we serve

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.780
you the lowest latency news.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.110
To help customers globally
scale API programs,

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.080
we're pleased to bring the
power of Google's networking

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:27.120
capabilities to API management,
Apigee X. The latest release

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.900
of Google Cloud's full lifecycle
API management platform,

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.890
it makes it easy and simple to
apply Cloud Content Delivery

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.010
Network, CDN, to APIs.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.860
Working in tandem, the two
solutions-led enterprises

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.470
not only secure and
manage their APIs,

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:47.160
but also make them available
across a global ecosystem

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.400
of stakeholders.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.800
With the start of
baseball upon us,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.070
learn how BigQuery
helps scale and automate

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:58.850
insights for baseball
fans and businesses alike.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.760
And while baseball serves
as a fun playground,

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.860
parts of the
process outline here

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:07.880
can be used across all
industries that have big data

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.020
and want to turn it into timely,
contextual, succinct bits

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:16.070
of valuable information with
vastly improved efficiency

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.100
relying on automation.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.770
Google Cloud is offering
no cost training

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:25.610
opportunities to help you
gain the latest AI and machine

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:26.990
learning skills.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:29.780
You'll have a chance to learn
more about the new document

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:32.870
AI along with explainable AI--

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:36.950
Looker, BigQuery ML,
and Dialogflow CX.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:40.420
Check out the blog
post to register.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:43.470
It's tough to resist
candy, and even tougher

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.540
to resist the magic of ML.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.180
So it's obvious why we
jumped at the opportunity

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:51.270
to collaborate with Mars,
Inc. on an AI-driven recipe

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.860
with Maltesers.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:56.580
Our own Sarah Robinson explore
the relationship between AI

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:59.530
and baking in order to
whip up something really,

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:01.230
really special.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.390
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.640
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.340
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.470
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.710
We'll see you in the Cloud.

